ely INDEPENDENT of it: the EH namespace is publicNetworkAccess Disabled so the wire is unreadable from outside the spoke, and App Insights retains about an hour so no consumer invocation is in the sink - UC-ROC-101 declined this fix for exactly that reason. NEVER FABRICATED - DEF-ROC-094s fix constraint: no id is generated; the last resort is the transport sequence number and then the EMPTY string, which routes the record to the malformed-identity rejected quarantine lane of DEF-ROC-030 - a recorded NAMED rejection instead of a silent collision"]:::def112changed
